Package: dataagent
Version: 1.0.0
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: DataAgent <support@dataagent.local>
Depends: bash, coreutils, curl, gpg, libgtk-3-0, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1
Recommends: cloudflare-warp
Description: LLM Data Analytics Agent with Cloudflare WARP support
 Installs the DataAgent desktop shell and web app with compiled binaries,
 plus the opencode CLI and the Cloudflare WARP client so the Data Agent AI's
 egress-IP rotation works out of the box.
 .
 Launch the DataAgent shell from the desktop menu; for headless servers run:
     sudo systemctl enable --now dataagent